            "description": "The Company Policy Assistant supports employees and managers by providing guidance on company policies within the Global Human Resources framework. It helps address questions related to policy interpretation, compliance, and application, ensuring consistent understanding and adherence across the organization.",
            "name": "Company Policy Agent",
